================================================================
3. UNDERLYING PUBLIC DATA
================================================================
Portions of the footprint are derived from public datasets that
remain under their original terms, including:
  - U.S. Geological Survey — National Hydrography Dataset (NHD)
  - Florida Department of Environmental Protection — basin and
    planning-unit data
  - Florida municipal boundary (city limits) data, 2021

C-HAWQ's compilation, delineation, classification, and added
attributes are the copyrightable contribution licensed above and
do not restrict independent use of the original public sources.

